#: gui/datawiz.c:2901
msgid ""
"The current dataset holds daily data on an incomplete calendar\n"
"(missing values are skipped rather than recorded as such).\n"
"\n"
"If you wish, gretl can pad the data (insert NAs) to create a\n"
"complete calendar. But note that this may make it difficult to\n"
"apply time-series methods, many of which cannot handle missing\n"
"values within the sample range. If you decide to do padding, you\n"
"can choose the number of days per week (5, 6 or 7) for the\n"
"completed calendar.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Orainko datu multzoak kalendario osatu gabean oinarritutako eguneroko\n"
"datuak ditu. (balio faltak saltatu egingo dira, horrela markatu ordez).\n"
"\n"
"Hautaz, gretlek datuak betetzea (NA-ak sartzea) eskaintzen du,\n"
"kalendario osatu bat sortzeko. Baina kontuan izan hori denbora-serie\n"
"metodoak aplikatzea zaildu dezakeela, horietako askok ezin dutela\n"
"kudeatu lagin-eremuko balio faltak. Betetzea erabakitzen baduzu,\n"
"asteko egun kopurua aukeratu ahal izango duzu (5, 6 edo 7) kalendario\n"
"osatuarentzat.\n"
"\n"
"Segitu nahi al duzu?"

